    howToApply: "Before reading, ask: will this take three or more search or read turns, or is it a sweep? If yes, start the explorer role as a subagent (or, where your harness has none, a separate session in the same folder) and ask for a digest, not a dump. If no, do it inline. When the digest returns and you need one pointer, read that exact span yourself. A subagent whose brief is bounded and whose output you check can run on a cheaper model if your harness lets you choose.",
