    howToApply: "Before any wait, ask what ends it. A machine: background it and let your harness notify you, then do other work. A person: that is not a wait at all: raise the question and land what you can. A bounded wait's condition must be the real end state (the process's exit status), not a log line that also appears mid-run. A dispatched result nobody read is unverified, not passed.",
